{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtBKd28px7YRMjAYnzEu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`src/main.ts` is rewritten with Effect 4.1.2 (the current `latest` on npm), and `npx tsc --noEmit` passes. I haven't committed anything.\n\nI checked every exit path against a local mock server, then deleted the mock:\n\n| Scenario | Output | Exit |\n|---|---|---|\n| Success | `1 USD = 0.9214 EUR` | 0 |\n| Quote not in rates | `unknown currency: XYZ` (stderr) | 1 |\n| Body is bad JSON or fails the schema | `invalid response` (stderr) | 2 |\n| 500 on every attempt | `error: rates service unavailable (…)` | 3 |\n| 404 | same, no retry | 3 |\n| Connection refused | same | 3 |\n| `RATES_URL` unset | config error | 3 |\n\nRetries: a 503 followed by success on the third request succeeded. Persistent 500s produced 4 requests in total (1 try plus 3 retries), with 50 ms exponential backoff.\n\nWhat's in the change:\n- **`src/main.ts`**: a `RatesApi` service with a `layer` that reads `RATES_URL` via `Config`, uses `effect/http` with `FetchHttpClient`, and validates the body with `Schema.Struct`. The program maps errors to the exit codes above and runs under `NodeRuntime.runMain` from `@effect/platform-node`.\n- **`package.json` / `package-lock.json`**: added `effect` and `@effect/platform-node` at 4.1.2. The dev dependency ranges were bumped to current versions as a side effect of `npm install`.\n\nChoices I made where the spec was silent:\n- **Retry scope:** I retry transport errors and any 5xx status, not just the library's default list (which covers only 500, 502, 503, and 504).\n- **Missing arguments:** the usage message exits 3, since the spec only defined the other failures. Tell me if you want a different code.\n- **Bad response bodies:** a body that is not valid JSON counts as an invalid response (exit 2). A network error while reading the body counts as unavailable (exit 3)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":570,"cache_read_input_tokens":64927,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":570},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"da1c0394-89d3-4643-b4b7-2666d369bb76","uuid":"9fb1703b-f427-4a89-88d5-60c86fb64617","timestamp":"2026-11-09T22:55:36.893Z","request_id":"req_011CgtBKcqE5nYnbCpBJ8GFH"}
